            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Thanks for the suggestion!\r\n\r\nThe 'mini.completion' module intentionally has only two-stage completion model (mostly equivalent to having two sources, main and fallback). It is [not planned to add more sources](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/d330f2639462084d2ef6c699ccd6219b81c45bc7/doc/mini-completion.txt#L50).\r\n\r\nClosing as not planned.",
